{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52773","headline":"三桥 · 张旭","name":"三桥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北临白云涧，南望清风阁。\n出树见行人，隔溪有鱼跃。\n（均见《式古堂书画汇考》卷七引《张长史四诗帖》。\n此帖末有柯九思、高仁卿、陶宗仪等跋。\n陶跋云此帖「《宣和书谱》所载，初爲蔡忠惠公〖襄〗家藏，後入御府」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张旭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52773.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52773","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}